      <title>Author Explores Cybersecurity Risks of Driverless Cars</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-08-30/author-explores-cybersecurity-risks-of-driverless-cars-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">71b4365046c261cbfab1cdc0</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:55:56 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Former New York City Traffic Commissioner Sam Schwartz joins hosts Christina Ruffini and Bailey Lipschultz on Bloomberg This Weekend and warns that the expansion of autonomous vehicles brings cybersecurity risks, including the possibility that bad actors could seize control of connected cars and use them as weapons. His new novel, Autokill, explores that threat while Schwartz argues that autonomous vehicles still have significant safety potential if companies provide greater transparency and governments prepare for emerging risks. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
